# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CITIZEN DOCUMENTS MUST NEVER ENTER THIS TREE.
#
# This repo sits inside OneDrive, which syncs to Microsoft's cloud. A real caste
# certificate, income certificate or land record dropped in here would silently be
# uploaded offsite and would be very hard to recall. These patterns are a safety net,
# not permission — see the warning in RUNNING.md.
#
# The PWA's own icons are the deliberate exception below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.bmp
*.heic
*.pdf
*.scan

!web/public/icon-*.png
